 calls stubbed â€” writing a dated health report and surfacing failures as a red dashboard banner.\n\n- **Its single declared deliverable is `anchor_gui.py`** â€” the running dashboard app itself.\n\n**Current state:** v3 is built (all 10 waves GREEN) and merged to master; the active branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v4` holds an approved **v4 redesign** in progress â€” a calmer single-screen per-project cockpit (lane tiles with one honest status light, in-place summary stacked over a real resizable terminal, skill auto-loads/greets exactly once).\n\nWant me to verify any of these against the live code, or is this for a doc/blurb?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4420,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":41003,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53454983-376a-4990-ac5d-94ef4536cccb","uuid":"a71a60cd-62b7-4386-abbd-a2effbeae62d","request_id":"req_011CbykhzGCUJefjk4UoxP8f"}
